      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Save me, O God, by thy name,\nAnd judge me in thy might.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.54.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.54.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hear my prayer, O God;\nGive ear to the words of my mouth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.54.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.54.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For strangers are risen up against me,\nAnd violent men have sought after my soul:\nThey have not set God before them. [Selah",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.54.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.54.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, God is my helper:\nThe Lord is of them that uphold my soul.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.54.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.54.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He will requite the evil unto mine enemies:\nDestroy thou them in thy truth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.54.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.54.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "With a freewill-offering will I sacrifice unto thee:\nI will give thanks unto thy name, O Jehovah, for it is good.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.54.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.54.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he hath delivered me out of all trouble;\nAnd mine eye hath seen ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "my desire",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon mine enemies.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
